# ---- Terraform / AWS (docs/notes/2026-09-03-aws-deployment-playbook.md section 7) ----
# NOTHING in this block may ever be committed. Terraform state holds every value Terraform
# touches, in plaintext.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
backend.hcl
!backend.hcl.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed - it is the provider lock, the peer of pixi.lock.

